SUMMARY:Free Tickets: The Magic Faraway Tree Canadian Premiere
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Dads Group\nToronto Dads has been invited to the Canad
 ian premiere of the new family film **The Magic Faraway Tree**\, and we ha
 ve **20 complimentary tickets** available for members and their families.\
 n\n**Date:** Saturday\, August 1\n**Arrival:** 10:00 a.m.\n**Film:** 10:30
  a.m.\n**Location:** Cineplex Yorkdale\, 3401 Dufferin Street\, North York
 \n\nDirector **Ben Gregor** will attend the screening and participate in a
  moderated Q&A following the film.\n\nBased on Enid Blyton’s bestselling
  novel\, *The Magic Faraway Tree* follows a big-city family that relocates
  to a remote village and discovers a magical tree. Its enchanted inhabitan
 ts transport the children to fantastical worlds and help the family reconn
 ect.\nThe cast includes Andrew Garfield\, Claire Foy\, Nonso Anozie\, Nico
 la Coughlan\, Jessica Gunning\, Jennifer Saunders and Rebecca Ferguson.\n\
 n**To request tickets\, please RSVP with:**\n• One full name and email a
 ddress for your group\n• The total number of tickets requested\n\nAdmiss
 ion will be by guest list. Requests must be received by **Friday\, July 31
  at 10AM**\n\nPlease only RSVP if you are confident you can attend.
